{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中國香港隊在上海世界技能大賽奪得一面銀牌及14面優異獎章，合共15個獎項，刷新香港歷屆最好成績。<br/>\n<br/>\n行政長官李家超在政府總部與代表團會面，讚揚選手憑藉精湛工藝和拼搏精神，展現年輕一代的優秀技能和才華，以實際行動說好香港故事。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:03:50.894765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:45:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T23:16:20.202583+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:19.928952+00:00","content_hash":"751344edfb590d250acea3066ff090917f8dc58c9ffcee21018ae1b83ab674f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}